WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
video file and english subs: Safex

00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:07.207
Candy lost her confidence
in being a nurse.

00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:10.606
Headmistress Merry Jane
suggested her to take a vacation.

00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:17.144
Pony's Home in Candy's hometown
is welcoming her with passion.

00:00:20.988 --> 00:00:26.949
A cute bride.

00:00:36.804 --> 00:00:41.503
Mina, you need to know
how to climb a tree to be our friend.

00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:44.267
Push her up!

00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:47.780
You want to give up?

00:00:49.183 --> 00:00:52.243
Jimmy, stop teasing her.

00:00:53.721 --> 00:00:56.712
We are trying to teach her
how to climb a tree.

00:00:57.062 --> 00:00:59.856
Don't force her, take it easy.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:02.061
Let me help.

00:01:04.965 --> 00:01:07.859
Mina, don't be afraid of height.

00:01:08.009 --> 00:01:10.402
Come on, get up.

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.532
Is somebody here, Kurin?

00:01:14.682 --> 00:01:16.166
Where?

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:20.704
Mr. Matthew.

00:01:20.854 --> 00:01:21.876
Mr. Matthew?

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.177
Mr. Matthew.

00:01:25.327 --> 00:01:26.753
Mina.

00:01:31.058 --> 00:01:33.856
It's so heavy! Move away!

00:01:35.162 --> 00:01:36.493
Mr. Matthew.

00:01:37.498 --> 00:01:40.291
Candy!
I was wondering who it was!

00:01:40.441 --> 00:01:41.456
Nice to see you.

00:01:41.906 --> 00:01:45.163
It's been a long time.
You've grown up, Candy.

00:01:45.506 --> 00:01:48.441
Got a boyfriend?

00:01:49.343 --> 00:01:51.004
Come on, Mr. Matthew!

00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:55.406
Climbing is not as easy
when you get older.

00:01:55.556 --> 00:01:56.642
Let me see...

00:01:58.252 --> 00:01:59.719
Wait a minute!

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:02.347
- Is that....
- Tom's here!

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:04.788
That super cowboy.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.783
Hello, Candy.

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:12.059
Thank you for coming to Pony's home
to see me.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.959
No, I didn't know you were here.

00:02:16.156 --> 00:02:18.066
Why did you come here, Tom?

00:02:18.992 --> 00:02:21.502
I came for Mr. Matthew.

00:02:22.042 --> 00:02:25.032
There are no letters for you today.

00:02:25.182 --> 00:02:28.171
No, I need Sister Pony's letters.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:30.938
This?

00:02:31.088 --> 00:02:33.006
Yes, please give it to me.

00:02:33.156 --> 00:02:36.048
No, it's Sister Pony's letter.

00:02:36.198 --> 00:02:39.247
Tom, Why do you want
to take Sister Pony's letter?

00:02:39.597 --> 00:02:41.084
This is from my father.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:44.062
Right, the sender is Mr. Steve.

00:02:44.565 --> 00:02:47.163
Mr. Matthew, please!
Give the letter back to me!

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:50.128
Sorry, I can't do it.

00:02:51.205 --> 00:02:52.361
I see, Tom.

00:02:52.511 --> 00:02:56.599
Will your father's letter put
Sister Pony in a difficult situation?

00:02:56.749 --> 00:02:58.535
Please, Mr. Matthew.

00:02:58.685 --> 00:03:03.306
Tom,
it is my job to deliver the letter.

00:03:03.456 --> 00:03:04.975
I know, but...

00:03:05.986 --> 00:03:08.580
You must have said something bad.

00:03:08.956 --> 00:03:11.715
Like, Tom peed in his bed.

00:03:12.065 --> 00:03:14.623
Candy, I am 1 7 years old.

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.018
Sorry.

00:03:17.468 --> 00:03:18.723
Please, Mr. Matthew!

00:03:19.967 --> 00:03:23.092
Even the son
cannot take his father's letter.

00:03:23.242 --> 00:03:24.534
That doesn't harm!

00:03:24.772 --> 00:03:26.797
Not this one.

00:03:27.107 --> 00:03:29.934
Tom. Isn't this Tom?

00:03:30.084 --> 00:03:33.567
It's been a long time. You look good.

00:03:33.997 --> 00:03:35.113
Sister Pony.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.310
Let Sister Pony decide.

00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:50.788
Tom wants to take your letter.

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:53.188
Sister Pony.

00:03:53.638 --> 00:03:56.492
No, this is my letter.

00:03:56.942 --> 00:03:58.434
Sister.

00:03:58.906 --> 00:04:00.529
I'll hand it over to you now.

00:04:00.679 --> 00:04:03.569
- Thank you very much.
- Goodbye, Tom!

00:04:03.719 --> 00:04:04.876
Thank you very much.

00:04:05.679 --> 00:04:10.806
Promise me, Sister Pony.
Keep a secret for what's in the letter.

00:04:10.956 --> 00:04:14.547
Ok,
I promise you I'll keep the secret.

00:04:15.055 --> 00:04:18.218
Sister Pony, I won't tell anyone.

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:20.115
No, Candy.

00:04:20.665 --> 00:04:23.217
I am going back to the room
to read the letter.

00:04:23.367 --> 00:04:25.855
You can go back now.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:31.030
Too worried to go home?

00:04:32.039 --> 00:04:33.138
Nosy!

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:42.672
What are we going to do?

00:04:42.822 --> 00:04:45.711
What happened, Sister Pony?

00:04:45.991 --> 00:04:49.113
Sister Lane, look at this letter!

00:04:49.263 --> 00:04:52.522
But, this is for Sister Pony.

00:04:53.093 --> 00:04:54.784
That's ok. Look!

00:04:55.534 --> 00:04:56.594
Alright.

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:00.999
Tom...

00:05:06.273 --> 00:05:07.672
How is it?

00:05:08.542 --> 00:05:10.339
They seem to be surprised.

00:05:11.378 --> 00:05:12.640
No! Jimmy!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.970
Come on.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.016
I said, ''No!''

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:19.875
Alright.

00:05:20.687 --> 00:05:22.252
I won't peek.

00:05:23.857 --> 00:05:26.822
Tom is afraid
everyone would know about it.

00:05:29.663 --> 00:05:32.564
Don't do this. It's mean.

00:05:32.733 --> 00:05:34.491
Why don't you let us know?

00:05:34.641 --> 00:05:36.691
Yeah,
you are just like those grownups.

00:05:36.841 --> 00:05:38.668
What can't you tell us?

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:40.629
It's not your business.

00:05:40.779 --> 00:05:42.038
Tom.

00:05:42.242 --> 00:05:43.732
Sister Pony.

00:05:44.745 --> 00:05:49.341
Tom, I cannot keep the promise.

00:05:49.683 --> 00:05:51.075
Sister.

00:05:51.425 --> 00:05:53.914
Can we read the letter now?

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:56.114
Yes.

00:05:56.464 --> 00:05:58.546
You don't keep your word!

00:05:58.696 --> 00:06:02.349
No, this letter is not just for me.

00:06:02.499 --> 00:06:05.056
It is for everyone.

00:06:07.801 --> 00:06:10.133
Let me summarize it.

00:06:10.537 --> 00:06:16.665
Tom is getting engaged.
The banquet is at noon.

00:06:17.015 --> 00:06:18.745
Tom is getting engaged?

00:06:19.646 --> 00:06:21.910
Tom, is that true?

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:25.214
What does engaged mean?

00:06:26.153 --> 00:06:27.916
To have a lifelong mate.

00:06:28.622 --> 00:06:31.015
- A lifelong mate for Tom?
- Quiet!

00:06:31.165 --> 00:06:33.024
There is more.

00:06:34.127 --> 00:06:38.321
We sincerely invite Sister Pony and
Sister Lane to join the banquet.

00:06:38.571 --> 00:06:41.725
And welcome
all the children to join as well.

00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:43.760
Please, you must show up!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.599
- Congratulations, Tom!
- Congratulations, Big Brother!

00:06:48.749 --> 00:06:50.101
Listen...

00:06:50.551 --> 00:06:51.973
Congratulations!

00:06:52.479 --> 00:06:54.208
Congratulations!

00:06:54.481 --> 00:06:56.381
What's wrong, Cassie?

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.916
Sister, can kids be engaged?

00:07:02.189 --> 00:07:06.824
Cassie, Tom is not a kid.
He is seventeen.

00:07:09.596 --> 00:07:13.323
I can't believe Tom is getting engaged.

00:07:13.473 --> 00:07:16.869
Listen to me. Sister.

00:07:21.308 --> 00:07:25.074
So, this is your father's decision?

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:28.636
Father and his friend's decision.

00:07:28.996 --> 00:07:31.843
Why didn't you say ''No. ''at the time?

00:07:33.587 --> 00:07:34.986
Of course I wanted to say ''No. ''

00:07:35.322 --> 00:07:37.483
But,
Father already had a deal with someone.

00:07:39.926 --> 00:07:43.253
I knew you liked Diana!

00:07:43.703 --> 00:07:46.924
So I made a decision by myself.

00:07:47.634 --> 00:07:49.966
Congratulations!

00:07:52.906 --> 00:07:55.800
Father decided by himself.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.432
Her name is Diana?

00:07:58.982 --> 00:08:01.070
What is she like?

00:08:01.682 --> 00:08:04.810
I don't want to say bad things
about people.

00:08:05.252 --> 00:08:07.241
What can we do now, Sister Pony?

00:08:07.391 --> 00:08:09.549
It is tough.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.254
- Sister Pony!
- Candy.

00:08:13.226 --> 00:08:16.785
Sister, let me talk to Mr. Steve.

00:08:17.364 --> 00:08:18.453
Candy.

00:08:18.603 --> 00:08:22.126
Sorry, I listened to your conversation.

00:08:22.769 --> 00:08:25.670
Candy,
are you really going to my home?

00:08:25.839 --> 00:08:30.208
Yes. I want to let Mr. Steve
know how you really feel.

00:08:30.844 --> 00:08:34.104
That's great!
Father is going to listen to you!

00:08:34.254 --> 00:08:37.650
Wait! Sister Pony!

00:08:38.719 --> 00:08:41.210
Candy, go ahead.

00:08:43.156 --> 00:08:45.814
The wedding isn't done yet.

00:08:45.964 --> 00:08:49.953
You can also visit the Steve's Farm.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.191
Is it really a good idea, Sister Pony?

00:08:53.341 --> 00:08:56.127
It's not good for us to say something.

00:08:56.277 --> 00:08:59.672
Candy is not a child anymore.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.768
Ok.

00:09:05.245 --> 00:09:08.544
We have always been the trouble makers,
since we were little.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:13.078
We grew up together.

00:09:13.753 --> 00:09:16.144
But, my father is very stubborn.

00:09:16.294 --> 00:09:21.018
No matter how stubborn he is, it is
not right to force you to get married.

00:09:21.368 --> 00:09:24.386
You must have someone you like.

00:09:25.899 --> 00:09:28.491
That's why
you care about this thing so much.

00:09:28.802 --> 00:09:30.206
Tom...

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:33.228
I do have someone I like.

00:09:33.378 --> 00:09:37.071
But we parted to follow our dreams.

00:09:38.278 --> 00:09:42.713
There are many things that I want to do.
I don't want to get married so early.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.840
Hurry!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.755
Tom is back!

00:10:03.937 --> 00:10:06.997
Diana, the groom is back!

00:10:10.377 --> 00:10:11.567
I am back.

00:10:11.717 --> 00:10:12.872
You are back.

00:10:13.747 --> 00:10:16.272
Welcome back, honey.

00:10:31.832 --> 00:10:33.556
Welcome, Candy.

00:10:33.706 --> 00:10:35.396
Hello, Mr. Steve.

00:10:36.136 --> 00:10:38.192
I am Diana.

00:10:38.342 --> 00:10:40.547
Thank you for caring about Tom.

00:10:40.697 --> 00:10:42.567
Nice to meet you.

00:10:42.717 --> 00:10:44.940
Tom, she is the bride?

00:10:45.679 --> 00:10:47.802
Yes, that's her.

00:10:48.152 --> 00:10:50.883
Here, Candy, come on in.

00:10:51.384 --> 00:10:53.284
Honey, give me the hat.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.313
Enough!

00:10:55.463 --> 00:10:57.982
Being shy in front of the guest?

00:10:59.226 --> 00:11:00.750
Diana!

00:11:02.762 --> 00:11:04.430
Come on, let's get ready to eat.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:08.834
I expect it to taste good.

00:11:24.884 --> 00:11:25.983
Are you alright, Diana?

00:11:26.887 --> 00:11:28.946
Why didn't you ask me to help?

00:11:31.825 --> 00:11:33.622
Anything wrong?

00:11:34.127 --> 00:11:38.154
Nothing, Diana is acting stupid.

00:11:40.233 --> 00:11:42.390
Go back to the seat. You are the guest.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:43.764
Yes.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:55.272
Tom and Diana are more than just a few
years apart, just like me and my wife.

00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:59.174
You got married at a young age,
too?

00:11:59.324 --> 00:12:03.222
No. I was 29, and my wife was 19.

00:12:03.423 --> 00:12:05.823
I want to wait till I am 29, too.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.854
That's ok. Reserve for the future.

00:12:11.004 --> 00:12:14.291
The earlier the better. Right, Diana?

00:12:14.441 --> 00:12:17.198
This... I...

00:12:18.038 --> 00:12:20.871
I like it to be earlier, too.

00:12:21.908 --> 00:12:24.672
Tom, what a lovely bride.

00:12:25.278 --> 00:12:26.540
Candy.

00:12:26.813 --> 00:12:31.113
Diana, give me Father's red wine.

00:12:35.288 --> 00:12:37.518
Candy, try to convince Father now.

00:12:38.591 --> 00:12:43.150
Mr. Steve,
the reason I am today is....

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:46.596
I understand.
To congratulate on Tom's engagement.

00:12:49.903 --> 00:12:52.246
Candy, we had a deal.

00:12:52.396 --> 00:12:56.464
Ouch! The bride is so lovely....

00:12:56.614 --> 00:12:58.131
You are so mean, Candy!

00:12:58.281 --> 00:13:00.902
Tom, stop talking in private.

00:13:01.052 --> 00:13:03.244
If you are a man,
say out loud for what you want to say.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.340
Then I am going to say it.

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:08.042
That's a man!

00:13:08.492 --> 00:13:11.521
Father,
I don't want to be engaged with Diana.

00:13:13.026 --> 00:13:15.961
Every man has to get married.

00:13:16.129 --> 00:13:18.962
Father,
Diana is not who I truly like.

00:13:19.532 --> 00:13:21.858
Is there someone better than Diana?

00:13:22.008 --> 00:13:23.526
Candy.

00:13:24.137 --> 00:13:25.399
Tom!

00:13:25.739 --> 00:13:27.206
You...

00:13:35.014 --> 00:13:35.974
Diana!

00:13:42.088 --> 00:13:44.283
Tom, you are an idiot!

00:13:46.826 --> 00:13:48.054
Diana!

00:13:52.232 --> 00:13:53.253
Wait, Diana!

00:13:53.403 --> 00:13:55.493
Why did you say that?

00:13:55.735 --> 00:14:00.331
Sorry. If I hadn't said it like this,
Father wouldn't have listened to me.

00:14:00.673 --> 00:14:04.040
Is it also ok to hurt Diana?

00:14:05.145 --> 00:14:06.737
I made a mistake.

00:14:12.018 --> 00:14:14.243
The kids are asleep.

00:14:14.693 --> 00:14:18.290
Thanks a lot.
Candy hasn't come back yet?

00:14:19.426 --> 00:14:22.725
I hope she can change Mr. Steve's mind.

00:14:32.005 --> 00:14:33.131
Father!

00:14:39.179 --> 00:14:40.578
Candy!

00:14:46.486 --> 00:14:48.278
What happened?

00:14:48.428 --> 00:14:50.948
Who did you fight with, father?

00:14:51.458 --> 00:14:56.293
I was not fighting with anyone,
I was beaten by Diana's father.

00:14:56.529 --> 00:14:58.087
Diana's father?

00:14:58.664 --> 00:15:00.724
I went to cancel the engagement.

00:15:01.174 --> 00:15:03.234
Father, aren't you mad at me?

00:15:03.736 --> 00:15:09.102
I have always wanted you to marry Candy.

00:15:09.676 --> 00:15:11.501
You misunderstood, Father.

00:15:11.651 --> 00:15:13.612
You are being shy again.

00:15:14.514 --> 00:15:16.137
I gave up on the relationship.

00:15:16.287 --> 00:15:19.739
She was adopted by the Adleys,
and studied abroad.

00:15:19.889 --> 00:15:23.781
Our family will never catch up on
her family with a farm like this.

00:15:23.931 --> 00:15:25.653
Mr. Steve, you misunderstood.

00:15:26.726 --> 00:15:28.318
I did.

00:15:30.597 --> 00:15:31.489
Father.

00:15:31.639 --> 00:15:34.260
Come on, let's celebrate!

00:15:35.335 --> 00:15:36.626
Great!

00:15:36.776 --> 00:15:39.830
There will still be a banquet.

00:15:42.442 --> 00:15:46.970
Tom and Candy's banquet, of course.

00:15:47.547 --> 00:15:49.271
Wait a minute, Mr. Steve.

00:15:49.421 --> 00:15:51.472
Calm down, Father!

00:15:51.622 --> 00:15:54.109
I am happy for you two.

00:16:03.096 --> 00:16:05.587
Honey, you are back.

00:16:05.832 --> 00:16:08.198
I wanted it to be earlier, too.

00:16:10.236 --> 00:16:12.803
It's my entire fault.

00:16:13.806 --> 00:16:15.171
Come in.

00:16:15.842 --> 00:16:16.964
Where is Mr. Steve?

00:16:17.114 --> 00:16:18.733
Drunk, and sleeping now.

00:16:18.883 --> 00:16:20.435
What should we do, Tom?

00:16:20.785 --> 00:16:22.481
Don't worry about the banquet.

00:16:29.992 --> 00:16:32.182
The invitations?

00:16:32.732 --> 00:16:37.093
Father wanted me to send them out,
but I hid them somewhere.

00:16:37.897 --> 00:16:39.997
And Sister Pony's letter?

00:16:40.867 --> 00:16:46.594
Father missed that one,
and sent it out separately.

00:16:46.944 --> 00:16:49.398
So you were trying to catch it
before it arrived.

00:16:49.848 --> 00:16:52.307
Candy, sorry for the trouble.

00:16:52.912 --> 00:16:55.772
I am ok.
Will Mr. Steve be mad at you?

00:16:56.322 --> 00:16:58.275
The worst that could happen is
to be punished, and I am ready for that.

00:16:58.425 --> 00:17:00.011
Good night, Candy.

00:17:02.488 --> 00:17:04.319
Good night.

00:17:24.744 --> 00:17:27.736
Mr. Steve, are you still feeling sick
from last night's drinking?

00:17:28.381 --> 00:17:29.672
The chest.

00:17:29.822 --> 00:17:31.006
The chest?

00:17:31.156 --> 00:17:34.444
That's alright.
It will get better in a couple of days.

00:17:34.594 --> 00:17:38.285
But, chest pain is not a small thing.

00:17:38.591 --> 00:17:41.025
Sorry, I feel better now.

00:17:41.394 --> 00:17:43.294
Should we wake Tom up?

00:17:43.529 --> 00:17:45.754
Wait, Candy,
I have something to say to you.

00:17:45.904 --> 00:17:48.561
But, you need to rest.

00:17:48.735 --> 00:17:51.528
I often forget things.

00:17:51.678 --> 00:17:54.436
Often? Did Tom know about it?

00:17:54.941 --> 00:17:57.430
I don't want him to be worried.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:00.068
But, you are father and son.

00:18:05.184 --> 00:18:08.877
Candy, I know
there's not much time left for me.

00:18:09.027 --> 00:18:12.079
You know? Did you see a doctor?

00:18:12.229 --> 00:18:15.215
I know about my body
better than anyone else.

00:18:15.665 --> 00:18:17.125
Nonsense!

00:18:18.831 --> 00:18:21.698
Candy, please take care of Tom.

00:18:25.071 --> 00:18:26.329
I don't want to!

00:18:26.479 --> 00:18:27.460
Candy!

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:34.376
You thought that you were going to die.
so you were anxious to get Tom married.

00:18:34.881 --> 00:18:38.476
I wanted to have a daughter-in-law
before I die.

00:18:38.998 --> 00:18:43.045
How do you know you are going to die,
if you don't go see a doctor?

00:18:43.495 --> 00:18:44.610
What do doctors know.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:47.050
Don't look down on doctors.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.682
In order to save people's lives,

00:18:48.832 --> 00:18:52.356
do you know how hard,
doctors and nurses try?

00:18:53.733 --> 00:18:54.855
Candy!

00:18:55.005 --> 00:18:56.922
I am sorry if I offended you.

00:18:57.072 --> 00:19:01.063
I am currently
studying in a nursing school.

00:19:01.374 --> 00:19:02.828
You?

00:19:03.278 --> 00:19:05.999
Tom sees you as his real father.

00:19:06.149 --> 00:19:09.604
For Tom's sake,
please come to the hospital with me.

00:19:11.617 --> 00:19:13.141
Tom...

00:19:14.754 --> 00:19:16.187
What are you doing, Tom?

00:19:16.856 --> 00:19:18.716
Father is an idiot!

00:19:19.066 --> 00:19:20.617
I am your father.

00:19:20.767 --> 00:19:24.595
I won't be happy just because
you let me take over the farm.

00:19:24.997 --> 00:19:28.988
What I care is Father's health.

00:19:29.138 --> 00:19:30.055
Tom.

00:19:30.205 --> 00:19:34.970
If you leave me,
I'll become an orphan again.

00:19:37.543 --> 00:19:41.467
The person I like is not Diana or Candy.

00:19:41.617 --> 00:19:43.139
It's Father!

00:20:04.871 --> 00:20:08.530
Idiot! A man does not cry!

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:12.042
Mr. Steve,
go to the hospital to check your body.

00:20:13.346 --> 00:20:17.876
Go!
I don't care if he wants it or not.

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:26.922
That's great!

00:20:27.126 --> 00:20:29.784
Be good friends of Tom's forever.

00:20:29.934 --> 00:20:31.454
Ok.

00:20:35.902 --> 00:20:37.767
I am coming.

00:20:39.472 --> 00:20:40.905
You are good, Candy!

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:46.677
Diana,
do I smell like the hospital?

00:20:50.316 --> 00:20:52.147
No.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.783
I am making a wreath for Tom.

00:21:02.061 --> 00:21:07.590
The medicine smell on her body
is gradually getting away.

00:21:08.167 --> 00:21:10.724
It is the first time
that Candy feels lonely...

00:21:10.874 --> 00:21:15.297
since she came to the nursing school.

00:21:15.675 --> 00:21:20.942
She is eager to go back to the hospital
for a path of her own.
